               "date_time": {
                  "type": "gregory",
                  "year": "2026",
                  "month": "",
                  "day": ""
               }
            }
         ],
         "text": [
            {
               "text": "#### Conclusion\n\nIn this class we learned the multiplication table of five. We also observed the relationship between this table and our body: our hands and our feet are groups of five.\n\nWhile we were studying, we also learned that the table of five only has 0 and 5 in the units place.\n\nWith the tables of zero, one, two, three, four and five, our multiplication map keeps growing!",
               "source": [],
               "date_time": null,
               "isTable": false,
               "imgdesc": "",
               "format": "markdown",
               "PostMention": ""
            }
         ],
